    "THE ANCHOR RUNG IS A RE-RUN, NOT A COPY (disclosed): the top rung re-runs e260's committed RANDOM arm on this session's silicon (the room bit-identical by seed; the stream bit-identical by construction) so the ladder is one instrument on one session; the anchor gate binds the re-run to the committed record (L2 + behavior within the disclosed session texture). Cross-pass cuBLAS/atomics noise is the family's inherited law (e260's G_FREE matched g1c at L2 7.06e-4).",
